// WindowImposter_DX90 (windowimposter_ps20b / windowimposter_vs20): the cube
// map along the eye-to-vertex vector (the camera at the origin looks at a quad
// whose corners reach into the +x, -x, +y, -y and +z faces), times the
// modulation color, alpha blended with $alpha; with and without range fog.
// In HDR LoadCubeMap loads the ".hdr" name, which holds the same texels.
